{
  "_doc": "Justice stages. `civic_actions` (Phase 015) names the civic records that correspond to a stage: a recorded case filing corresponds to the complaint stage, and a recorded verdict or remedy statement to the judgment stage. The world records that correspondence only; residents decide whether a stage was carried out validly.",
